# Doppler is the source of truth: project aitp-website, configs dev (local),
# dev_personal, stg, prd (Vercel Production, synced by deploy/doppler-sync.sh).
# The site builds with no variables today, so every config is empty.
#   doppler setup --project aitp-website --config dev   # once per checkout
#   doppler run -- npm run dev
# Without Doppler access nothing is needed locally.
#
# Not deployment variables, documented for reference only:
# - Vercel deploys through its Git integration; no Vercel token is stored in
#   GitHub.
# - The cross-repo docs sync (sync-docs.yml, and notify-website.yml in each
#   source repo) authenticates as the aitp-deps-bot GitHub App: org secrets
#   AITP_BOT_APP_ID and AITP_BOT_PRIVATE_KEY, org variable AITP_BOT_CLIENT_ID.
